  "description": "Vamoose is always ahead of the curve, crafting what you crave before you even know you need it. That’s why we don’t just call it the Mammoth—we call it the \"Super\" Mammoth. And guess what? We’ve dialed up the awesome for the 2025 lineup! Our improvements aren’t just changes; they’re upgrades that redefine the ride. Ready to see why the Super Mammoth sets the bar? Let’s roll!SUPER MAMMOTH 750 AWD SO - DUAL MOTOR MONSTER!Power up and push boundaries with the 2025 Vamoose Super Mammoth AWD! This e-bike is a beast, boasting twin 52V 750W motors (yup, front and back) that deliver insane power and torque—perfect for hill climbs or blazing through untouched trails. Upgraded with a torque sensor for precision handling, the Super Mammoth rides smoother and reacts faster than ever. It’s packed with a massive 52V 20Ah battery, cranking out a jaw-dropping 1040 watt-hours for a ride range of over 84km. And for those epic adventures? Opt to add a second 52V 15Ah battery, boosting your journey to a staggering 150km with 1850 watt-hours of power. The 2024 Super Mammoth isn’t just an e-bike; it’s your ticket to thrill!This cycle comes standard with the following adders:\n\n• Dual 52V 750W motors (ability to downsample to 500W)\n\n• 52V 20 Ah Samsung Battery with additional battery optional\n\n• A 6061 aircraft aluminum frame with alloy front forks\n\n• 26\" x 4.8” Fat Tires\n\n• Front and rear fenders\n\nYes - RIGHT HAND TWIST\n\nKD986 Display w Bluetooth, downsampling, USB\n\n21700 50 E CELLS 52V 20 Ah Samsung\n\nBOXER Inverted air fork 140mm travel\n\nTektro HD-E730 Dorado 4 PISTON Hydraulic 203 mm ROTOR, 2.3 mm thick\n\n26\" x 4.8\" MAXXIS MINION FBR FBF\n\nRear, with front mount option\n\n4-6 hrs.\n\n166 x 34 x 86.5\n\n66 X 13 X 34\n\n41kg NW / 51 kg GW\n\n90 lbs NW / 112 lbs GW\n\n330 lbs.",
